description.narrative:
The overall objective of the Strategic Plan of Aleanca is:

LGBTI citizens in Albania live in self-acceptance and self-realization, part of a society that accepts and includes them, where the state guarantees them freedom and equal rights.

The Strategic Plan has 4 outcomes:

1) Improving Albanian legislation to enable the prevention of hate crimes and hate speech, non-discrimination and equal treatment of LGBTI citizens;

2) Increasing access of LGBTI citizens to LGBTIQ affirming services and meeting their basic needs; 

3) Awareness of Albanian society for diversity, inclusiveness, respect for human rights, and acceptance of the LGBTI community by challenging and changing negative stereotypes and promoting positive representation;

4) To ensure that the Alliance functions as a dedicated and dynamic organization, with effective governance, healthy systems, financial stability, transparency, accountability and a dedicated and professional team.
